{
    "title": "EIC VM Fundraising Assessment EU Survey Import",
    "name": "eic_vm_fundraising_assessment_eu_survey_import",
    "is_active": "1",
    "description": "This FormProcessor ingests the EIC Awardee Fundraising Assessment EU-Survey and creates or updates a VentureMatch Service Request case (eic_sr_venturematch).\r\n\r\nThere is no PIC number in this form. The company is resolved through the XCM profile 'EU_Survey_VM_Fundraising_Company' (matching on Company LinkedIn URL, Company Name and Company Website URL); if no company matches an EIC Organisation is created. The company-level survey answers are stored on the Organisation in the 'EIC Fundraising Assessment' custom group, and the Company LinkedIn URL on the 'Organisation identifiers' group.\r\n\r\nThe EIC Project is matched by EIC project number (fallback: acronym). A VentureMatch SR case is found for the company (project uniqueness is NOT enforced for now); if none exists it is created with status Requested and the shared 'EIC Awardee information' group is populated with what is available from the matched project. The Founder's Primary Contact is found or created (matched on email; email set as main email, phone as main phone) and linked to the case in the 'Founder' role. A Task activity 'EU Survey received' (status Completed) is added to the case.",
    "output_handler": "OutputAllActionOutput",
    "output_handler_configuration": [],
    "enable_default_data": "0",
    "default_data_output_configuration": [],
    "calculation_output_configuration": [],
